ld be unbanned? Well, I have a few reasons. So back to the story; We were looking around on the internet and were watching video about banning hackers, I was talking to her about how hilarious and exiting it was to be able to go on Avicus and be able to know, your a Mod. She started talking about how she had always wanted to be one and that I should have still been one (I trust you guys, but she's just being a supportive friend) So she got mad and she took my computer searched in “Easy hacks to download” She was raging and stuff so I took it back. She said “You should get some!” I didn't really want to but I did it anyway. I was all amped up and stuff, so we were looking at the easier ones to download and the smaller ones. There was packs and stuff, but I didn't want to be caught. In this case, I did. I was caught and thrown out. I honestly think I have learned my lesson. Some people might have not, but I am a mature person and realize the consequences.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(120, 25, 95); -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(120, 25, 95); -webkit-text-stroke-width: initial; min-height: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(120, 25, 95); -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(120, 25, 95); -webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003ePersonally, the reason I should be unbanned is because I have done so much to contribute. 1. I have made multiple maps with ItzRilo. 2. I have donated twice, once a gold and the second time a Emerald rank 3. I have applied, and successfully became a Jr. Mod, in this case I would like to repeat. 4. I have so many friends on The Walls that I think would want to see me again\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp